WEBVTT

00:10:28.707 --> 00:10:30.209
(Laughter)

00:10:30.876 --> 00:10:33.712
That protected area in the Seal River
Watershed I mentioned,

00:10:33.712 --> 00:10:37.132
it holds 1.7 billion tons of carbon

00:10:37.174 --> 00:10:41.261
equivalent to eight years’ worth
of greenhouse-gas emissions alone --

00:10:41.303 --> 00:10:42.638
in Canada alone.

00:10:43.097 --> 00:10:47.017
Protecting the watershed will help
keep that carbon in place.

00:10:47.685 --> 00:10:51.105
These are the kind of lands
that guardians are caring for.

00:10:52.189 --> 00:10:54.733
They also help heal and restore places.

00:10:54.775 --> 00:10:56.777
The Innu guardians, for example,

00:10:56.777 --> 00:11:00.280
they help care for and monitor
the largest nickel mine in the world